 362+ 744D              ; ==============================================================================
 363+ 744D              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath - BFS reverse con state (sid, comp_local)
 364+ 744D              ; ==============================================================================
 365+ 744D              ; Algoritmo:
 366+ 744D              ;   1. queue.push((target_sid, target_comp=0)). Mark visited.
 367+ 744D              ;      target_comp = 0 (heurística: el pickup vive en la comp principal).
 368+ 744D              ;   2. While queue not empty:
 369+ 744D              ;        (R, R_comp) = queue.pop()
 370+ 744D              ;        For each gap in RoomCompGaps[R]:
 371+ 744D              ;          If gap.comp != R_comp: skip.
 372+ 744D              ;          V = neighbor of R via gap.side.
 373+ 744D              ;          Find V's gap with side=opposite(gap.side) AND coord=gap.coord.
 374+ 744D              ;          V_comp = that gap's comp.
 375+ 744D              ;          If (V, V_comp) visited: skip.
 376+ 744D              ;          If V == current_sid AND V_comp == player_current_comp:
 377+ 744D              ;            dir_player = opposite(gap.side); STORE; RETURN.
 378+ 744D              ;          Mark visited; queue.push((V, V_comp)).
 379+ 744D              ;
 380+ 744D              ; player_current_comp se determina via LastEntrySide:
 381+ 744D              ;   - LastEntrySide = side por el que el player entró a current_sid.
 382+ 744D              ;   - player_comp = comp del gap de current_sid en LastEntrySide.
 383+ 744D              ;   - Si LastEntrySide = $FF (boot/respawn), comp = 0 (fallback).
 384+ 744D              ;
 385+ 744D              ; OUT: MagicCompassPathDir = 0=N, 1=E, 2=S, 3=W; o $FF si sin path.
 386+ 744D              ; ==============================================================================
 387+ 744D              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath — wrapper que pagina bank 7 alrededor del BFS.
 388+ 744D              ; Las tablas RoomCompGaps_XX viven en bank 7 (movidas para liberar slot 1
 389+ 744D              ; del overflow). RoomCompGapsTable (pointer table) sigue en slot 1, pero
 390+ 744D              ; sus valores son addresses en $C000+ que solo se dereferencian con bank 7
 391+ 744D              ; paginado. El BFS body (renombrado a _Inner) solo llama a helpers .cmcp*
 392+ 744D              ; (todos en slot 1) — ningun CALL externo a bank 0.
 393+ 744D              ;
 394+ 744D              ; SP alterno (slot 1) durante el chunk BFS para no enmascarar IRQs. El Inner
 395+ 744D              ; LEE bank 7 (RoomCompGaps_XX) pero no escribe. Con SP alterno, los PUSH/POP
 396+ 744D              ; del propio Inner y los del handler IRQ van al alterno (bank fijo) en lugar
 397+ 744D              ; de a bank 7 -> los datos del BFS en bank 7 quedan intactos. Sin DI.
 398+ 744D              ; Ver project_paging_alt_stack.md.
 399+ 744D              ; ==============================================================================
 400+ 744D              ComputeMagicCompassPath:
 401+ 744D ED 73 78 74      LD (.cmcpSavedSP), SP
 402+ 7451 31 CE 6B         LD SP, PagingAltStackTop
 403+ 7454                  ; --- Page bank 7 in slot 3 (sin DI; SP alterno) ---
 404+ 7454 3A 82 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 405+ 7457 E6 F8            AND $F8
 406+ 7459 F6 07            OR 7
 407+ 745B 32 82 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 408+ 745E 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 409+ 7461 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 410+ 7463
 411+ 7463 CD 7A 74         CALL _ComputeMagicCompassPath_Inner
 412+ 7466
 413+ 7466                  ; --- Page bank 0 back ---
 414+ 7466 3A 82 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 415+ 7469 E6 F8            AND $F8
 416+ 746B 32 82 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 417+ 746E 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 418+ 7471 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 419+ 7473 ED 7B 78 74      LD SP, (.cmcpSavedSP)
 420+ 7477 C9               RET
 421+ 7478 00 00        .cmcpSavedSP: DEFW 0
