 333  80CD CD 2B B7         CALL TrySpawnNasty          ; Spawn check (tiene su propio timer)
 334  80D0 CD FE BD         CALL TryRespawnMonsters     ; Rellenar slots monster vacios (siempre 3)
 335  80D3 CD 15 C6         CALL UpdateDeathTimer       ; Tick contador 10s + spawn la muerte si toca
 336  80D6 CD 53 C2         CALL CheckPlayerEnemyCollision ; Colision player vs enemigos
