 503+ 8FC2 86               ADD A, (HL)
 504+ 8FC3 32 BA 97         LD (MaiGapScreenId), A
 505+ 8FC6
 506+ 8FC6                  ; IFF tracking via StartupComplete (RAM) - evita race del LD A,I
 507+ 8FC6 F3               DI
