1039+ 9246 0F               RRCA
1040+ 9247 0F               RRCA
1041+ 9248 0F               RRCA
1042+ 9249 E6 1F            AND $1F
1043+ 924B 4F               LD C, A                         ; C = cy actual
1044+ 924C
1045+ 924C 3A C2 97         LD A, (MaiFlowLastCx)
1046+ 924F B8               CP B
1047+ 9250 20 05            JR NZ, .mrfRecompute
1048+ 9252 3A C3 97         LD A, (MaiFlowLastCy)
1049+ 9255 B9               CP C
