1317+ 93F5              ; CheckPlayerZoneAtChar - test si la celda (D=cy, E=cx) es alcanzable
1318+ 93F5              ; ==============================================================================
1319+ 93F5              ; Lee FlowField (bank 6) en offset cy*32+cx. FlowField se actualiza al cambiar
1320+ 93F5              ; de sala via MaiComputeFlowField llamado desde DrawScreen.
1321+ 93F5              ; OUT: Z si NO alcanzable (FlowField == $FF), NZ si alcanzable.
