 259+ 99D3 E6 F8            AND $F8
 260+ 99D5 32 82 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 261+ 99D8 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 262+ 99DB ED 79            OUT (C), A
 263+ 99DD FB               EI
 264+ 99DE C9               RET
