2108+ AA65 7E               LD A, (HL)
2109+ AA66 FE 0D            CP STAMINA_DRAIN_RATE
2110+ AA68 D8               RET C
2111+ AA69 36 00            LD (HL), 0
2112+ AA6B 3A 0D B3         LD A, (PlayerStamina)
2113+ AA6E 3D               DEC A
2114+ AA6F 32 0D B3         LD (PlayerStamina), A
