2580+ ACDB                  ; --- Movimiento horizontal ---
2581+ ACDB DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
2582+ ACDE 32 97 AD         LD (.savedEX), A
2583+ ACE1 47               LD B, A
2584+ ACE2 DD 7E 06         LD A, (IX+ENT_DELTAX)
2585+ ACE5 4F               LD C, A
2586+ ACE6                  ; Test signo para ADD signed
2587+ ACE6 CB 79            BIT 7, C
2588+ ACE8 20 0A            JR NZ, .eDeltaXNeg
