2607+ AD01 28 0E            JR Z, .eXDone
2608+ AD03                  ; Colision → revertir X e invertir delta
2609+ AD03 3A 97 AD         LD A, (.savedEX)
2610+ AD06 DD 77 03         LD (IX+ENT_POSX), A
