5665+ BDF8              MonsterTypeTable:
5666+ BDF8 4C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_0
5667+ BDF9 54               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_1
5668+ BDFA 5C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_2
5669+ BDFB              MonsterColorTable:
5670+ BDFB 44               DEFB $44                            ; Zombi: verde
5671+ BDFC 46               DEFB $46                            ; Skeleton: amarillo
5672+ BDFD 45               DEFB $45                            ; Ghost: cyan
