7558+ C8FF 32 DF 82         LD (GameOver), A
7559+ C902 32 B7 82         LD (CurrentObjective), A
7560+ C905 32 AE 82         LD (CurrentKey), A
7561+ C908 32 B2 82         LD (ChurchEverOpened), A
7562+ C90B 32 B1 82         LD (ChurchDoorOpen), A
7563+ C90E 32 B3 82         LD (TimeFrozen), A
