2307+ D7D8                  ; Reset frame counter, decrementar toggles
2308+ D7D8 3E 03            LD A, PICKUP_FLASH_PERIOD
2309+ D7DA 32 D3 82         LD (PickupFlashFrames), A
2310+ D7DD 3A D2 82         LD A, (PickupFlashToggles)
2311+ D7E0 3D               DEC A
2312+ D7E1 32 D2 82         LD (PickupFlashToggles), A
