2334+ D7F6 47               LD B, A                         ; mapX
2335+ D7F7 23               INC HL
2336+ D7F8 3A 08 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
2337+ D7FB B8               CP B
2338+ D7FC C2 4B D9         JP NZ, .cbtSkipMapY
2339+ D7FF 4E               LD C, (HL)                      ; mapY
2340+ D800 23               INC HL
2341+ D801 3A 09 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
