 204+ E2FB              .sNotPressed:
 205+ E2FB                  ; --- Tecla D: decrementar DayCycleCount (baja velocidad nasties) ---
 206+ E2FB CB 51            BIT 2, C                ; D key: bit 2 (0=pulsada)
 207+ E2FD 20 13            JR NZ, .dNotPressed
 208+ E2FF 3A 36 E3         LD A, (SpeedKeyDebounce)
