 454+ F9C3              .bcPhKnocks2:
 455+ F9C3 3E 03            LD A, BCS_GROUP2_KNOCKS
 456+ F9C5 CD 2D FB         CALL BankCutsceneTickKnockGroup
 457+ F9C8 B7               OR A
 458+ F9C9 C8               RET Z
