 660+ FB01 C0               RET NZ
 661+ FB02                  ; Player gira a camara final.
 662+ FB02 DD 21 9B 81      LD IX, EntityTable
 663+ FB06 3E 00            LD A, SPRID_IDLE
 664+ FB08 DD 77 00         LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), A
 665+ FB0B DD 77 08         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), A
